To replace every instance of a specific word with a synonym in a given string using Java, you can use the `String.replace()` method. In your case, you want to replace the word "accordingly" with a synonym, let's say "consequently." Here's the Java code to achieve this:

```java
public class ReplaceWord {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        String input = "The police closed the streets accordingly.";
        String target = "accordingly";
        String replacement = "consequently";

        String output = input.replace(target, replacement);

        System.out.println(output); // "The police closed the streets consequently."
    }
}
