1. Set up a Facebook App: To use the Facebook JavaScript SDK, you need to create a Facebook App. Go to https://developers.facebook.com/apps/ and follow the steps to set up an app. Once your app has been created, take note of the App ID.

2. Load the JavaScript SDK: Include the following code in your HTML, replacing 'your-app-id' with your actual App ID.

