How can I use Java code to generate a list of potential book titles for 'The Great Gatsby' that not only reflects the novel's themes but also touches upon relevant contemporary issues and evokes emotional responses from readers? Additionally, how can we incorporate user feedback and preferences in the title generation process to ensure maximum resonance with the target audience? 
