    // Click on the 'Send Offer' button
    cy.get('[data-cy=send-offer-button]').click();

    // Ensure the offer has been sent successfully
    cy.get('[data-cy=offer-sent-notification]').should('be.visible');

    // Logout as the Custodial Buyer
    cy.logout();

    // Login as the Non-Custodial Seller to accept the offer
    cy.loginAsNonCustodialSeller();

    // Go to the received offers page or appropriate location
    cy.visit('/received-offers-page');

    // Find the offer from the Custodial Buyer and click to open the Offer Modal
    cy.findByOfferByCustodialBuyer().click();

    // Ensure the Offer Modal is visible
    cy.get('[data-cy=offer-modal]').should('be.visible');

    // Click on the 'Accept Offer' button
    cy.get('[data-cy=accept-offer-button]').click();

    // Ensure the transaction has been settled successfully
    cy.get('[data-cy=transaction-settled-notification]').should('be.visible');
  });
});
```

This spec outlines the steps required to test the user story, ensuring that a Logged-in Custodial Buyer can create a Non-Instant Buy offer and settle a transaction with a Logged-in Non-Custodial Seller via the Offer Modal.

